## Two tori side by side under one light -- a full one tilted so
## its hole shows, and a partial one (thetamax below 360, a band with a
## negative phimin). This fixture overrides two of AGENTS.md's RIB
## authoring rules -- "Translate 0 0 5" and "one scene, one thing" -- on
## quadrics.rib's and r5b_quadrics.rib's own precedent; Format and Translate
## here are this fixture's own, sized so each torus covers well clear of
## GOLDEN_MAX_FRACTION.
Display "r5c_torus.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 640 480 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [50]
Clipping 1 30
Translate 0 0 7
WorldBegin
LightSource "ambientlight" 1 "intensity" [0.2]
LightSource "distantlight" 2 "intensity" [1.2] "lightcolor" [1 1 1]
	"from" [1 1 -5] "to" [0 0 0]
Sides 1
Surface "matte" "Ka" [0.3] "Kd" [0.9]

AttributeBegin
	Translate -1.8 0 0
	Rotate 60 1 0 0
	Torus 1.3 0.5 0 360 360
AttributeEnd

AttributeBegin
	Translate 1.8 0 0
	Rotate 60 1 0 0
	Torus 1.3 0.5 -60 60 270
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
